    <Description>This Combo has made for gauntlets
The objective of that combo is doing one of the hardest mechanics of gauntlets that is dlight - jump chase dodge - n-air

The commands that im using for that macro are : Light Attack : Mouse1
                                                                             AWSD: Movement Commands
                                                                             Space: Jump
                                                                             Shift: Dodge
In order to the macro work you need to have all commands set up like that.
Combo of macro : Down-Light (S+M1) -&gt; Jump Chase Dodge -&gt; N-Air in perfect timing

The macro was made by Away#7646 in 24/05/2022</Description>
